{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Game Background:</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On an autumn flight to a vacation resort, your plane crashes onto a secluded island. You awaken to find yourself rescued by the indigenous <i>Kakabu Tribe</i>. The chief, <i>Adesilobufu</i> (nicknamed &quot;Ad&quot; for short), declares you a &quot;divine messenger&quot; and grants you a patch of wasteland to prove your worth. But the island is far stranger than it seems\u2014from a lumberjack terrified of bees to a high priest who passes off coconut water as &quot;holy elixir,&quot; everyone harbors bizarre secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features\uff1a</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farming &amp; Crafting</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivate crops, gather resources, and craft tools to improve the tribe\u2019s living conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/extras/1-min.gif?t=1745478728\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Maze Challenges</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore mysterious mines and ancient ruins in search of hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/extras/8-min.gif?t=1745478728\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Hidden Locations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover abandoned plane wreckage, cryptic stone carvings, and even the legendary <i>Altar of the Sea God</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/extras/5-min.gif?t=1745478728\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hilarious Festivals &amp; Competitions</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the <i>Annual Fishing Tournament</i> or compete in the <i>Pigback Major Championships</i> (where rules change on a whim).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/extras/4-min.gif?t=1745478728\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt for Legendary Items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the <i>Golden Fishhook</i>, a <i>Pirate\u2019s Treasure Map</i>, or the priest\u2019s dubious &quot;weather-predicting potions.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/extras/7-min.gif?t=1745478728\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meet Unique Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with over 10 quirky tribespeople, each with their own backstory and questline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/extras/NPC-EN.png?t=1745478728\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684140?t=1745478728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/f9b6a2d15dd31f2cd54e8243267305b1ece8476a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745478728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/f6e515dfc7bb244900d9810261a3920439efbc27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745478728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684140/f6e515dfc7bb244900d9810261a3920439efbc27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745478728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Game Background:</i></